
### ==========================================
### LAB 6 - EXCEPTION HANDLING & VALIDATION
### ==========================================


### Exercise 1 & 2 - Get existing event
### Expected: 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/2


### Exercise 1 & 2 - Get non-existing event
### Expected after solving: 404 Not Found + JSON error
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/999


### Exercise 1 & 2 - Another non-existing event
### Expected after solving: 404 Not Found + JSON error
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/100


### ==========================================
### EXERCISE 3 & 4 - INPUT VALIDATION
### ==========================================


### Valid event - Expected: 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Java Conference",
  "category": "Technology"
}


### Invalid event - Empty name and category
### Expected after solving: 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "category": ""
}


### Invalid event - Name too short
### Expected after solving: 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hi",
  "category": "Technology"
}


### Invalid event - Blank category
### Expected after solving: 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Spring Workshop",
  "category": "   "
}


### Invalid update - Empty name
### Expected after solving: 400 Bad Request
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/events/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "category": "Technology"
}
